<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Izira Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Izira Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Izi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Izira</para>
  <para style="mt1">Izira Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Izira maxaafay, Ayhudetape di7etidi bida guutha asati Babiloonepe simmidaysanne Yerusalaamen de7oynne goyinno wogay ooraxidaysa odees. Ha hanotati kaallidi de7iya kesotan qoncidosona.</para>
  <para style="ipi">1. Farse kawa Qiroosa shenen koyro Ayhudeti di7ope simmidosona.</para>
  <para style="ipi">2. Xoossa keethay zaari keexetidi anjetis; Xoossa goyinno wogay zaaridi doometis.</para>
  <para style="ipi">3. Daro laythafe guye, Xoossa higge astamaare gidida Iziri kaalethin, hara Ayhudeti Yerusalaame simmidosona. Iziri, Isra7eele asay ammano de7uwanne issifetetha duussaa zaarana mela maaddidi, enta ayyaana de7uwanne sa7a duussa zaaridi minthis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Izira maxaafay nam7u kifilen shaaketees.</para>
  <para style="ipi">1. Shempo 1—6 gakanaw de7iya kifiley, Yihuda asay K.Y.S. 538 laythan Yerusalaame simmidaysanne goyinno woga essidaysa odees.</para>
  <para style="ipi">2. Shempo 7—10 gakanaw de7iya kifiley, daro laythafe guye Iziri asaa tamaarsanaw Yerusalaame yidaysa odees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Ayhude asaa di7ope simuwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EZR 1:1-2:70">1:1—2:70</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossa Keethay zaaridi keexo doometethi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EZR 3:1-4:6">3:1—4:6</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusalaame zaari keexo bolla medhetida metuwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EZR 4:6-23">4:6-23</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossa Keetha oosuwa wursethaa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EZR 4:24-6:22">4:24—6:22</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iziri asaa kaalethidi Yerusalaame ehuwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EZR 7:1-8:36">7:1—8:36</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Allaga maccasata ekida addeti banta macheta yeduwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EZR 9:1-10:44">9:1—10:44</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1" />
  <para style="s1">Qiroosa Awaajuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1" />Farse kawoy Qiroosi kawotida koyro laythan, nabiya Ermiyaasa baggara Goday odidaba polis. Farse kawoy Qiroosi ba kawotethaa giddon haysada yaagidi awaajana melanne he awaajuwa xaafidi wothana mela Goday iya wozana denthethis. <verse eid="EZR 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2" />Farse kawoy Qiroosi haysada yaagees; “Goday, salo Xoossay ha sa7aa kawotethata ubbaa taw immis. Qassi Yihudan de7iya Yerusalaamen iyaw keethe keexana mela tana shuumis. <verse eid="EZR 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3" />Xoossa asi gidida oonika yaa boo; iya Xoossay iyara gido! Hinte Yihudan de7iya Yerusalaame bidi, yan Yerusalaamen Godaa, Isra7eele Xoossaa keethaa zaaridi keexo. <verse eid="EZR 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4" />Dumma dumma biittan de7iya asa ubbay Ayhudetape attidaysati bira, worqa, dumma dumma miishetanne mehe immidi maaddo; qassi Yerusalaamen de7iya Xoossaa keethaa banta dosan immiya imota bolla gujidi immo” yaagees.<verse eid="EZR 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5" />Hessafe guye, Yihudanne Biniyaame koche halaqati, kahinetinne Leeweti, qassi Xoossay enta wozanaa denthethida ubbay Yerusalaamen Godaa Xoossaa keethaa keexanaw baanaw dendidosona. <verse eid="EZR 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6" />Qassi enta shooron de7eysatika banta dosan immidaba bolla gujidi, birapenne worqafe oosetida miisheta, hara dumma dumma miishetanne mehe immidi, enta maaddidosona. <verse eid="EZR 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7" />Hessa bolla kawoy Qiroosi Nabukadanaxoori Yerusalaamepe efidi ba eeqa keethan wothida Godaa keethaa miisheta immis. <verse eid="EZR 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:8" />Farse kawoy Qiroosi miisheta wothiya keetha halaqaa Mitirdaaxu taybisidi, Yihuda haariya Sesabisaara kushen wothis. <verse eid="EZR 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9" />Simmida miisheta tayboy haysa; hastamu worqa shaate, mukulu bira shaate, laatamanne uddufun pil7o, <verse eid="EZR 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10" />hastamu worqaa kere, oyddu xeetanne tammu bira kere mukulu hara dumma dumma miishe. <verse eid="EZR 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11" />Worqa miishetanne bira miisheta tayboy kumethi ichashu mukulunne oyddu xeeta; Seesabisari Babiloonepe Yerusalaame simmiya wode di7ope simmida asaara ekidi yis.<verse eid="EZR 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2" />
  <para style="s1">Di7ope Simmida Asa Taybo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NEH 7:4-73">Nahi 7:4-73</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1" />Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori di77idi, ba biitta efida asaape guye, Yerusalaamenne Yihuda banta katamaa katamaa simmida asay haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata. <verse eid="EZR 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2" />Enta halaqati Zarubaabela, Iyyasu, Nahime, Saraya, Ra7ila, Mardikiyoosa, Bilisaana, Masefaara, Baguwaya, Rehuumanne Ba7ana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 2:2">Di7ope simmida asaa tayboy haysa.<verse eid="EZR 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3" />Faroosa yaray 2,172;<verse eid="EZR 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4" />Safaaxa yaray 372;<verse eid="EZR 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5" />Era yaray 775;<verse eid="EZR 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6" />Iyyasunne Yo7aaba koche gidida Fahat-Moo7abe yaray 2,812;<verse eid="EZR 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7" />Elama yaray 1,254;<verse eid="EZR 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8" />Zata yaray 945;<verse eid="EZR 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9" />Zakaya yaray 760;<verse eid="EZR 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10" />Baana yaray 642;<verse eid="EZR 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11" />Bebaya yaray 623;<verse eid="EZR 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12" />Azgada yaray 1,222;<verse eid="EZR 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13" />Adonqaama yaray 666;<verse eid="EZR 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14" />Beguwaya yaray 2,056;<verse eid="EZR 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15" />Adina yaray 454;<verse eid="EZR 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16" />Hizqiyaasa koche gidida Axeera yaray 98;<verse eid="EZR 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17" />Basaya yaray 323;<verse eid="EZR 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18" />Yoora yaray 112;<verse eid="EZR 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19" />Hasuma yaray 223;<verse eid="EZR 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20" />Gibara yaray 95;<verse eid="EZR 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21" />Beeteleme asay 123;<verse eid="EZR 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22" />Naxoofa asay 56;<verse eid="EZR 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23" />Anatoota asay 128;<verse eid="EZR 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24" />Azmoota asay 42;<verse eid="EZR 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25" />Qiriyat-Yi7aarima, Kafiranne Bi7eroota asay 743;<verse eid="EZR 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26" />Ramanne Gib7a asay 621;<verse eid="EZR 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27" />Mikmaasa asay 122;<verse eid="EZR 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28" />Beetelenne Gaye asay 223;<verse eid="EZR 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29" />Nabo asay 52;<verse eid="EZR 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30" />Magibisa asay 156;<verse eid="EZR 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31" />Nam7antho Elama asay 1,254;<verse eid="EZR 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32" />Karima asay 320;<verse eid="EZR 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33" />Looda, Hadidanne Ono asay 725;<verse eid="EZR 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34" />Iyaarko asay 345;<verse eid="EZR 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35" />Sana7a asay 3,630;<verse eid="EZR 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36" />Di7ope simmida kahineta soo asaa tayboy haysa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:36">Iyyasu koche gidida Yadaya yaray 973;<verse eid="EZR 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37" />Imera yaray 1,052;<verse eid="EZR 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38" />Paskora yaray 1,247;<verse eid="EZR 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39" />Karima yaray 1,017.<verse eid="EZR 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40" />Di7ope simmida Leeweta tayboy haysa;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:40">Hodawa koche gidida Iyyasunne Qadimeela yaray 74;<verse eid="EZR 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41" />Asaafa koche gidida zammaareti 128;<verse eid="EZR 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42" />Xoossa keetha penge naagiya Salooma, Axeera, Xalmoona, Aquba, Haxixanne Sobaya yaray 139.<verse eid="EZR 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43" />Haysati di7ope simmidi, Xoossa keethan oothiya asaa yarata; Xiha yara, Hasufa yara, Xaba7oota yara, <verse eid="EZR 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44" />Keraasa yara, Siha yara, Fadoona yara, <verse eid="EZR 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45" />Libana yara, Agaba yara, Aquba yara, <verse eid="EZR 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46" />Agaba yara, Samila yara, Hanana yara, <verse eid="EZR 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47" />Gadalla yara, Gahaara yara, Raya yara, <verse eid="EZR 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48" />Ra7asoona yara, Naqooda yara, Gasaama yara, <verse eid="EZR 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49" />Oza yara, Faseeha yara, Besaya yara, <verse eid="EZR 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50" />Asina yara, Me7unima yara, Nifuseesima yara, <verse eid="EZR 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51" />Baqibuuqa yara, Haqufa yara, Harhura yara, <verse eid="EZR 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52" />Basiluuta yara, Mahida yara, Harsa yara, <verse eid="EZR 2:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53" />Barqoosa yara, Sisaara yara, Teema yara, <verse eid="EZR 2:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54" />Nasiya yaranne Haxifa yara.<verse eid="EZR 2:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55" />Haysati di7ope simmida Solomone oosanchota yarata; Soxaya yara, Sofeereta yara, Faruuda yara, <verse eid="EZR 2:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56" />Ya7ila yara, Darqoona yara, Gadalla yara, <verse eid="EZR 2:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57" />Safaaxa yara, Haxeela yara, Fakiraata yara, Haxaboyma yaranne Ama yara. <verse eid="EZR 2:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58" />Di7ope simmidi, Xoossa keethan oothiya asa yaratinne Solomone aylleta yarata tayboy 392.<verse eid="EZR 2:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59" />Haysafe kaalleysati qassi Talmela, Telaresa, Karuba, Adaananne Imera katamatape Yerusalaame simmidosona. Shin enti woyko enta aawati Isra7eele sheeshi gideysa erisanaw enti danda7ibookona. <verse eid="EZR 2:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:60" />Dalaya, Xoobbiyanne Naqooda yarati 652.<verse eid="EZR 2:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61" />Kahinetape Abaya yaray, Aqoosa yaraynne Barzile yaray simmidosona. Barziley ha sunthan xeegetanaw danda7iday Galada biitta asi gidida Barzile na7iw macho ekida gishosa. <verse eid="EZR 2:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62" />Haysati banta yeleta xaphuwa eranaw yeleta maxaafan koydosona, shin demmibookona. Hessa gisho, enti tuna geetetidi kahinetethan oothonna mela digetidosona. <verse eid="EZR 2:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63" />Uriimeninne Tumiimen shaakidi pirdiya kahiney dendana gakanaw, enti geeshsha kathaafe maanaw danda7onaysa Ayhudeta ayseysi entaw odis.<verse eid="EZR 2:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64" />Di7ope Yihuda simmida asaa tayboy kumethi 42,360. <verse eid="EZR 2:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65" />Hessika 7,337 addenne macca aylleta gujunna de7ishina. Enta giddon 200 addenne macca zammaareti de7oosona. <verse eid="EZR 2:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66" />Di7ope simmida asaa parati 736; baquloti 245; <verse eid="EZR 2:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67" />gimaleti 435; hareti 6,720.<verse eid="EZR 2:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68" />Enti Yerusalaamen de7iya Xoossa keetha gakida wode issi issi soo asaa halaqati Xoossa keethay kase ba bessan keexetana mela banta dosan imota immidosona. <verse eid="EZR 2:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69" />Issoy issoy baw danda7ida mela Xoossa keetha oosuwas imota immis; imotay 500 kilo giraame worqa, 2,800 kilo giraame biranne 100 kahineta ma7o immidosona.<verse eid="EZR 2:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70" />Hessafe guye, kahineti, Leewetinne guutha asay Yerusalaamen uttidosona; zammaareti, Xoossa keetha penge naageysatinne Xoossa keethan oothiya oosanchoti Yerusalaame yuushon de7iya katamatan uttidosona; attida asa ubbay banta katamatan katamatan uttidosona.<verse eid="EZR 2:70" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yarsho Bessay Zaaridi Keexetis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1" />Laapuntha ageenan Isra7eele asay banta de7iya katamatape issi asi gididi Yerusalaame shiiqidosona. <verse eid="EZR 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2" />Iyosadeqa na7aa Iyyasunne iyara oothiya kahineti, Salatiyaala na7aa Zarubaabelinne iya dabboti Xoossaa asi gidida Muse higgiyan xaafetidaysada xuussa yarsho yarshanaw, Isra7eele Xoossaas yarsho bessi giigisidosona. <verse eid="EZR 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3" />He biittan de7iya asaa ixuwape dendoysan yayyikoka, yarsho bessi kase bessan keexidi, xuu yarsho Godaas ubba wode wontanne omarsi shiishidosona. <verse eid="EZR 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4" />Kase xaafetidaysada Shaqara Ba7aale bonchidosona; xuussa yarsho issi issi gallas koshsheysada pacisonna yarshidosona. <verse eid="EZR 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5" />Qassi ubba wode shiiqiya xuussa yarsho, ageena xeero yarshonne Godaa geeshsha ba7aaletan yarshiya yarsho ubbaa yarshidosona. Hesaa bollaka asay ba dosan Godaas immida imota ubbaa yarshidosona. <verse eid="EZR 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6" />Xoossa keetha baasoy buroo doometonaba gidikoka Laapuntha ageenan koyro gallas enti Godaas xuussa yarsho shiisho doomidosona.<verse eid="EZR 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Keethay Zaaridi keexetis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7" />Hessafe guye, shuchu masseysatasinne anaaxetas miishe immidi ooso oykidosona. Farse kawoy Qiroosi entaw kiitida gisho, Libaanoosape ziga abba pinthidi, Yoophe ehanaw Sidoonanne Xiroosa asaas kathi, ushshinne zayte immidosona.<verse eid="EZR 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8" />Enti Yerusalaame simmida nam7antho laythan nam7antho ageenan, Salatiyaala na7ay Zarubaabeli, Iyosadeqa na7aa Iyyasuynne enta dabboti, kahineti, Leewetinne di7ope simmida asa ubbay Xoossa keetha kase bessan keexo doomidosona. Qassi Xoossa keetha oosuwa aawatethan xeellana mela laatamu laythi gididaysatanne laatamu laythafe aadhida Leeweta shuumidosona. <verse eid="EZR 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9" />Leewe koche gidida Iyyasu, iya naytanne iya dabboti, Hodawa soo asi gidida Qadimi7eelinne iya nayti issife gididi, Xoossa oosuwa oosisana mela aawatethi ekidosona; Enhadada koche gidida Leeweti enta maaddidosona.<verse eid="EZR 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10" />Anaaxeti Xoossa keethaa baasuwa yegethi oykiya wode, kahineti banta ma7o ma7idi moyze oykidi, Asaafa koche gidida, Leeweti daala oykidi, Isra7eele kawa Dawita wogaa mela Godaa galatanaw eqidosona. <verse eid="EZR 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11" />Enti Godaa galatishenne issoy issuwa kaali kaali mazmuren sabbishe, haysada yaagidi zammaridosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZR 3:11">“Goday keeha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 3:11">Isra7eeles de7iya iya siiqoy merinaasa” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZR 3:11">Xoossa keetha baasoy yegetiya gisho, asa ubbay banta qaala dhoqu oothidi ililishe Godaa galatidosona. <verse eid="EZR 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12" />Shin kase Xoossaa keetha be7ida cima kahinetape, Leewetapenne kochata halaqatape daroti ha77i Xoossa keetha keexanaw yegetida baasuwa be7ida wode banta qaala dhoqu oothidi yeekidosona; harati qassi ufaytishe bonchidosona. <verse eid="EZR 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13" />Oonika Ufaysa ililisaanne yeeho waasuwa shaakanaw danda7ibeenna; asay waassiya waasoy wolqaama gidiya gisho waasoy haahon si7etees.<verse eid="EZR 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4" />
  <para style="s1">Morkey Medhida Eqetethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1" />Yihudasinne Biniyaames morke gidida asay, di7ope simmidaysati Godaas, Isra7eele Xoossas keethe keexeysa si7idosona. <verse eid="EZR 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2" />Zarubaabelakonne Isra7eele yara halaqatako yidi, “Asoore kawoy Asiradooni nuna ha bessaa ehida gallasape doomidi, nuka hinte Xoossa goyinnoos, iyaw yarshoos. Hessa gisho, nuka hintera keexana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EZR 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3" />Shin Zarubaabeli, Iyyasuynne Isra7eele yara halaqati, “Nu Xoossaa keetha keexanaw nuusinne hintew gishoy baawa. Shin Farse kawoy Qiroosi kiittidaysada Godaa, Isra7eele Xoossa keetha nuuni nu xalaala keexana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EZR 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4" />Hessafe guye, he biittan de7iya asay, Yihuda asay Xoossa keetha keexonna mela ufaysi qanxisanawunne yashisanaw dendidosona. <verse eid="EZR 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5" />Farse kawa Qiroosa laythafe bidi Daariyosa kawotetha gakanaw enti Yihuda asaa zoreta laallana mela ase shammidosona.<verse eid="EZR 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Arxekisisas Xaafetida Dabdaabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6" />Arxekisisi kawotida wode Yihudanne Yerusalaame asaa mootanaw payle dooyidosona.<verse eid="EZR 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7" />Arxekisisa kawotetha laythan, Bishilaami, Mitridaati, Xabeelinne enta bagga gididi, Farse kawa Arxekisisas dabdaabe xaafidosona; he dabdaabey Aramike pidaleninne doonan xaafetis.<verse eid="EZR 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8" />Biitta aysiya Rehuuminne xaafey Simsayi Yerusalaameba haysada yaagidi, kawa Arxekisisas dabdaabe xaafidosona; <verse eid="EZR 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9" />“Ha dabdaabey biitta aysiya Rehuumape, xaafiya Simsayape, Beteraplesape, Farsepe, Arkafe, Babiloonepe Suusapenne Elama biittan de7iya daynnatapenne biitta ayseysafe, <verse eid="EZR 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10" />qassi gitanne bonchetida kawa Asnafaari di77idi Samaareninne Efraxiisa Shaafape hefinthan wothida asa ubbaafe xaafetis” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EZR 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11" />Enta dabdaabey haysada yaagees; “Kawa Arxekisisas, Efraxiisa Shaafape hefinthan de7iya ne moorinatape yedetida dabdaabe.<verse eid="EZR 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12" />“Kawaw, ne matape nuuko yida Ayhudeti Yerusalaame yidi, ha makallanne iita katamiw zaaridi keexo bolla de7eysa era. I gimbe dirsa oorathosona; I baasuwa yeggoosona; I xaphuwa minthoosona. <verse eid="EZR 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13" />Hessa bolla qassi, ha katamiya keexetikonne I dirsa gimbey ooraxiko enti giiranne qaraxa qanxonnaysa era; kawo keethi geliya miishey guuxanaysa akeeka. <verse eid="EZR 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14" />Nuuni kawoy shuumin ootheyisata gidiya gishonne kawoy kawuyishin be7anaw koyonna gisho haysa ne erana mela gidi odoos. <verse eid="EZR 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15" />Hessa gisho, kase ne aawata taarike maxaafay koyetidi xeeleto; he xaafetidabape ha katamiya makallanne kawotasinne biittatas meto medhashe de7idaysa eranaw danda7aasa; hessa gaason iya laaletasu. <verse eid="EZR 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16" />Ha katamiya keexetiyanne I dirsa gimbey ooraxiyaba gidiko, Efraxiisa Shaafape hefinthan de7iya biittay ne kushepe keydaysa era” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EZR 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17" />Kawoy haysada giya zaaro entaw yeddis; “Biitta aysiya Rehuuma, xaafiya Simsaya, Samaareninne Efraxiisa Shaafape hefinthan de7iya entara issifida asaa saro gayis. <verse eid="EZR 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18" />Hinte taw yeddida dabdaabey birshetidi nabbabetin si7as. <verse eid="EZR 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19" />Ta kiitan, kase taarikey koyetidi xeeletiya wode, ha katamiya benipeka kawotas makallanne meto medhashe de7iya biitta gideysi eretis. <verse eid="EZR 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20" />Yerusalaamen wolqaama kawoti kawotidosona; Efraxiisa Shaafape hefinthan de7iya Biittafeka he kawoti giiranne qaraxa ekidosona. <verse eid="EZR 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21" />Hessa gisho, taani entaw ha kiita immana gakanaw, ha asati he katamiw keexeysa essana mela odite. <verse eid="EZR 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22" />Hinte ha oda qelli goonna mela naagetite; kawotas meto darsanaw koshshenna” yaagidi kiittis.<verse eid="EZR 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23" />Kawa Arxekisisa dabdaabey Rehuumas, xaafiya Simsayasinne entara de7iya ubbaas nabbabetida wode Yerusalaamen de7iya Ayhudetako ellesi bidi, enti keexeysa wolqan essidosona.<verse eid="EZR 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24" />He wodepe doomidi Yerusalaamen de7iya Xoossaa keetha oosoy Daariyosi kawotida nam7antho laythi gakanaw eqis.<verse eid="EZR 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5" />
  <para style="s1">Tantani Daariyosas Xaafida Dabdaabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1" />He wode nam7u nabeti Haggeynne Zakaryaasi Yihudaninne Yerusalaamen de7iya Ayhude asaas Isra7eele Xoossa sunthan tinbite odidosona. <verse eid="EZR 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2" />Salatiyaala na7ay Zarubaabelinne Iyosadeqa na7ay Iyyasuy dendidi, Yerusalaamen de7iya Godaa keethaa zaaridi keexanaw doomidosona. Xoossaa nabetika enta maaddishe entara de7idosona.<verse eid="EZR 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3" />He wode Efraxiisa Shaafape hefinthan de7iya biitta aysiya Tantani, Satarbuzaninne entara de7eysati Yerusalaame yidi, “Ha keetha hinte keexana mala hintew maata immiday oonee?” yaagidi oychidosona. <verse eid="EZR 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4" />Qassi, “Ha keetha keexiya asata sunthay oonee?” yaagidi oychidosona. <verse eid="EZR 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5" />Shin Xoossa ayfey Yihuda cimata bolla de7iya gisho, ha oday Daariyosako gakin, dabdaabey yaana gakanaw enta oonika ooso digibenna.<verse eid="EZR 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6" />Efraxiisa Shaafape hefintha biitta aysiya Tantanaya, Satarbuzaninne entara oothiya kawa Daariyosas xaafida dabdaabey haysa. <verse eid="EZR 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:7" />Enti iyaw yeddida dabdaabey haysada yaagidi nabbabetees.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 5:7">Kawa Daariyosa, saroy new gido.<verse eid="EZR 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8" />Nuuni Yihuda biittan de7iya gita Xoossaa keetha bidi be7idaysa kawoy ero. He Xoossa keethay gita shuchan keexetis; gimbe tuussati keyidosona; oosoyka gita akeekaninne eeson oosetishe de7ees.<verse eid="EZR 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9" />“Nuuni, Ha keetha keexana mala hintew maata immiday oonee?” yaagidi cimata oychida. <verse eid="EZR 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10" />Qassi entana kaalethiya asata sunthay ooneko xaafidi nena erisanaw enta oychida.<verse eid="EZR 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11" />Enti haysada yaagidi zaaridosona:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 5:11">“Nuuni salonne sa7a Xoossaa aylleta; nuuni daro laythafe kase gita Isra7eele kawoy keexidi polida keetha zaaridi keexoos. <verse eid="EZR 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12" />Nu aawati salo Xoossaa hanqethida gisho, I enta Babiloone kawa Nabukadanaxoora kushen aathidi immis. I ha keethaa laallis; asaa di77idi Babiloone biitta efis.”<verse eid="EZR 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13" />“Shin Babiloone kawoy Qiroosi ba kawotida koyro laythan, Xoossaa keethaa zaari keexana mela awaajo kessis. <verse eid="EZR 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14" />Nabukadanaxoori Yerusalaamen de7iya Xoossa keethaafe eki efidi, Babiloone biittan de7iya ba kawo gadhon wothida worqanne bira miishetaka Qiroosi zaaridi yeddis. He miisheti kawoy Qiroosi Yihuda biitta aysana mela doorida Sesabisaara kushen imetis. <verse eid="EZR 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15" />Kawoy, ‘Ha miisheta eka efada Yerusalaamen de7iya Xoossa keethan wotha; Xoossa keethayka kase de7iya bessan keexeto’ yaagin, <verse eid="EZR 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16" />Sesabisaari yidi, ‘Xoossa keethaa keexiya bessan Yerusalaamen baasis. I ha77i gakanaw wuribeenna; he wodepe doomidi, keexetishe de7ees’ ” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EZR 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17" />“Hiza ha oday kawa ufaysiyaba gidiko, ane kawoy Qiroosi ha Xoossa keethaa Yerusalaamen keexana mela, tumaka awaajuwa kessidaako eranaw kase aadhida Babiloone kawota taarike mazgabey koyetidi xeeleto. Hessafe guye, kawoy ha oda waatanaw qopidaako nuna eriso” yaagidi xaafidosona.<verse eid="EZR 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6" />
  <para style="s1">Daariyosa Awaajuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1" />Hessa gisho, kawoy Daariyosa kiitan, Babiloone de7iya miishe wothiya keethan de7iya taarike mazgabeta koydosona. <verse eid="EZR 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2" />Meedona awurajan Ahimata kataman issi xaatha maxaafi bentis; he maxaafan xaafetidabay haysada yaagees:<verse eid="EZR 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3" />“Kawoy Qiroosi ba kawotida koyro laythan, Yerusalaamen de7iya Xoossaa keethaa gisho, haysada giya awaajo kessis. Xoossaa keethay yarsho shiishiya bessi gididi zaari keexeto; iya baasoyka yegeto. He keetha adussatethay usupun tammu wadha, dalgatethay usupun tammu wadha gido. <verse eid="EZR 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4" />Heedzu toho gita shuchan yuushsho, issi toho mitha tuussati yuuyo. Hessas koshshiya miishe ubbay kawo shalo minjiya keethaafe imeto. <verse eid="EZR 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5" />Nabukadanaxoori Yerusalaamen de7iya Xoossa keethaafe ekidi, Babiloone ehida Xoossa keetha worqanne bira miisheti banta bessaa guye Yerusalaame simmidi; Xoossaa keethan de7o” yaagis.<verse eid="EZR 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6" />Hessafe guye, Daariyosi xaafida dabdaabey haysada yaagees. “Hinteno Efraxiisa Shaafape hefintha biitta aysiya Tatanaya, Satarbozinyanne entara ootheysato, ha Xoossa keethako shiiqopite. <verse eid="EZR 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7" />Ha Xoossaa keetha oosuwas dhube gidopite. Ayhudeta halaqatinne Ayhude cimati Xoossa keetha kase bessan zaaridi keexo.”<verse eid="EZR 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8" />Hessa bolla qassi, “Ha Ayhude cimati Xoossa keetha keexiya wode, enti oothiya oosoy eqonna mela entaw koshshiya miishe ubbaa Efraxiisa Shaafape hefintha biittafe shiishida kawa giira miishiyape entaw immana mela taani kiittas. <verse eid="EZR 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9" />Yerusalaamen de7iya kahineti salo Xoossas xuussa yarsho yarshanaw koshshiya wofaano gidin, maraze gidin woyko dorsa urge gidin entaw immite. Qassi aybaka pacisonna enti koyiya giste, maxine, woynenne zayte entaw gallas gallas immite. <verse eid="EZR 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10" />Hessa hinte immey enti salo Xoossaa ufaysiya yarsho yarshanaasanne kawuwasinne iya naytas woossanaasa. <verse eid="EZR 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11" />Ha awaajuwa laammiya oonika de7iko, iya keethaa tuussaa shoddidi, he tuussaa bolla iya kaqo; iya keethayka pito yeggiya besse gido. <verse eid="EZR 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12" />Ha kiita laammanaw woyko Yerusalaamen de7iya Xoossaa keethaa laallanaw kushe denthiya ay kawoy woyko asi gidin, ba sunthay xeegetana mela Yerusalaame doorida Xoossay iya dhayso. Taani Daariyosi haysa kiittas. Ha ubbay minotethan poleto” yaagis.<verse eid="EZR 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Keethi Anjiso Ba7aale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13" />Hessafe guye, Efraxiisa Shaafape hefintha biitta aysiya Tatanaya, Satarbuzaninne entara oothiya ubbay kawoy Daariyosi kiittidaysada minotethan oothidi polidosona. <verse eid="EZR 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14" />Ayhude cimati banta oosuwa aggonna oothidosona; qassi nabey Haggeynne Ido na7ay Zakaryaasi odida qaalan minetidosona. Isra7eele Xoossay kiittidaysada Farse kawoti Qiroosi, Daariyosinne Arxekisisi awaajidaysada Xoossa keetha keexidi wursidosona. <verse eid="EZR 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15" />Daariyosi kawotida usupuntho laythan Adaare geetetiya ageenan heedzantho gallasan, Xoossaa keetha oosoy poletis.<verse eid="EZR 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16" />Isra7eele asay, kahineti, Leewetinne di7ope simmida asa ubbay Xoossa keethaa anjisiya ba7aale ufaysan bonchidosona. <verse eid="EZR 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17" />He ba7aaley bonchetiya wode enti issi xeetu korma, nam7u xeetu maraze, oyddu xeetu dorsa urgeta yarshidosona. Qassi nagara yarshos tammanne nam7u Isra7eele kochata taybon tammanne nam7u kole yarshidosona. <verse eid="EZR 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18" />Muse Maxaafan xaafetidaysada, Yerusalaamen de7iya Xoossaa keethan oothana mela kahinetinne Leeweti enta maarada maarada wothidosona.<verse eid="EZR 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paasika Ba7aale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19" />Di7ope simmida asay koyro ageenan tammanne oyddantho gallas Paasika Ba7aale bonchidosona. <verse eid="EZR 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20" />Kahinetinne Leeweti bantana geeshshidosona; enti ubbay wogada geeydosona. Leeweti di7ope simmida ubbaas, kahinetasinne bantaw Paasika dorse shukidosona. <verse eid="EZR 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21" />Di7ope simmida Isra7eele asaynne Ayhude gidonna asay oothiya tunatethaafe bantana shaakidi, Godaako, Isra7eele Xoossaako simmida asa ubbay Paasika midosona. <verse eid="EZR 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22" />Goday Asoore kawa qofa laammidi Isra7eele Godaa, Xoossa keethaa keexidi polana mela maaddida gisho, enti laapun gallas Uytha Ba7aale ufaysan bonchidosona.<verse eid="EZR 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7" />
  <para style="s1">Iziri Yerusalaame Yuussaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1" />Daro wodepe guye, Farse kawua Arxekisisi kawotida wode Izira geetetiya issi asi de7is. Iziri Saraya na7a; Azaara na7a; Kalqe na7a; <verse eid="EZR 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2" />Saluma na7a; Saadoqa na7a; Akxuuba na7a; <verse eid="EZR 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3" />Amaare na7a; Azaara na7a; Marayoota na7a; <verse eid="EZR 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4" />Zaraha na7a; Oza na7a; Buqa na7a; <verse eid="EZR 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5" />Abisu na7a; Finihaasa na7a; Finihaasi Alaazara na7a; kahine halaqa Aarona na7a.<verse eid="EZR 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6" />Haysi Iziri Babiloonepe bis. Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay immida Muse higgiya eriya asi. Godaa, Xoossaa kushey iya bolla de7iya gisho, I oychidaba ubbaa kawoy iyaw immis. <verse eid="EZR 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7" />Kawoy Arxekisisi kawotida laapuntha laythan Isra7eele asaape guuthatara, kahineti, Leeweti, zammaareti, penge naageysatinne Xoossaa keetha oosanchoti Izirara issife Yerusalaame bidosona. <verse eid="EZR 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8" />Kawoy kawotida laapuntha laythan ichashantho ageenan Iziri Yerusalaame gakis. <verse eid="EZR 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:9" />Xoossaa lo77o kushey iya bolla de7iya gisho koyro ageenan koyro gallassi Babiloonepe keyidi, ichashantho ageenan koyro gallas Yerusalaame gakis. <verse eid="EZR 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10" />Iziri Godaa higgiya xanna7on, ooso bolla peeshoninne Isra7eele asaa iya wogaanne iya higgiya tamaarsanaw ba wozanaa giigisis.<verse eid="EZR 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Arxekisisi Iziras Xaafida Dabdaabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11" />Goday Isra7eeles immida higgiyanne wogga, loythi eriya kahinenne xaafe gidida Iziras kawoy Arxekisisi xaafida dabdaabey haysa.<verse eid="EZR 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12" />“Kawota Kawa Arxekisisape, kahinenne salo Xoossa higge loythi eriya Iziras, saroy new gido!<verse eid="EZR 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13" />“Ta kawotetha giddon de7iya Isra7eele asaape oonika, kahine woyko Leewe gidin, Yerusalaame baanaw koyiya asay neera baana mela taani kiittas. <verse eid="EZR 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14" />Taaninne taara zorettiya laapun asati issife gididi, ne kushen de7iya Xoossaa higgiyada, bada Yihudaninne Yerusalaamen de7iya hanotethay ay meleko oychana mela nena kiittoos. <verse eid="EZR 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15" />Yerusalaamen de7iya Isra7eele Xoossaas, taaninne taara zorettiya asati nu dosan immida worqanne bira imota ekada ba. <verse eid="EZR 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16" />Hessa bolla qassi neeni Babiloone biitta kumethaafe demmida biraanne worqaa ubbaa, qassi Isra7eele asaynne kahineti Yerusalaamen de7iya banta Xoossaa keethas dosan immida imota ekada ba. <verse eid="EZR 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17" />Ha miishiyan kormata, marazeta, dorsa urgetanne, katha yarshosinne ushsha yarshos koshshiyaba shammada, Yerusalaamen de7iya hinte Xoossaa keethan yarsho bessan yarsha.<verse eid="EZR 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18" />“Hessafe palahida biraanne worqaa neeninne neera de7iya Ayhude gidida ne ishati hinte Xoossa shenen, hinte oothanaw koiyaba oothite. <verse eid="EZR 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19" />Qassi nuuni hinte Xoossa keethaas, immida miisheta ubbaa Yerusalaame Xoossaa sinthan shiisha. <verse eid="EZR 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20" />Hessafe harabay Xoossaa keethas koshshiyabay aybika de7iko, kawo miishe minjiya keethaafe ekanaw danda7aasa.<verse eid="EZR 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21" />“Taani kawoy Arxekisisi Efraxiisa Shaafape hefinthan biittan de7iya miishe keethan aawatethay de7iya ubbatas ha kiita immas. Kahinenne Salo Xoossaa higgiya loythi eriya Iziri hintena oychiyabay ayba gidikoka iyaw immite. <verse eid="EZR 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22" />Heedzu mukulunne oyddu xeetu kilo giraame bira, issi xeetu kuntaale giste, nam7u mukulu litiro woyne ushshi, nam7u mukulu litiro shamaho zaytenne koshshiya mela maxine iyaw immite. <verse eid="EZR 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23" />Kawa bollanne kawa nayta kawotetha bolla hanqoy yoonna mela salo Xoossay ba keethas koyiyaba ubba immite. <verse eid="EZR 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24" />Kahinetape, Leewetape, zammaaretape penge naageysatape, Xoossa keetha oosanchotapenne Xoossaa keetha giddon dumma dumma ooso oothiya asaape hinte giiranne qaraxa ekanaw hintew maati baawa.<verse eid="EZR 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25" />“La Izira, neeni, new Xoossay immida cincatethan Efraxiisa Shaafape hefintha biittan de7iya ne Xoossaa higgiya eriya asaa bolla pirdana mela daynnatanne ayseysata shuuma. Higgiya eronna asi de7iko neeni enta tamaarsa. <verse eid="EZR 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26" />Ne Xoossaa higgiyanne kawa higgiya kiitetonna oonika de7iko, I qadhey bayna hayqo woyko gadepe goodeto woyko iya shaloy bonqeto woyko qashon seereto” yaagis.<verse eid="EZR 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27" />Yerusalaamen de7iya Xoossa keethaa haysada bonchetana mela kawa wozanan ha qofaa wothida Godaa, nu aawata Xoossaa galati gako! <verse eid="EZR 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28" />Kawa, kawuwara zoreteysatanne iyara oothiya wolqaama halaqata sinthan ba teema taw immida Xoossaas galati gido! Godaa, ta Xoossaa kushey taara de7iya gisho, Isra7eele halaqatape eretidaysata doorada Yerusalaame eka baana mela I taw minotethi gidis.<verse eid="EZR 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8" />
  <para style="s1">Izirara Di7ope Simmida Asa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1" />Kawoy Arxekisisi kawotida wode taara issife Babiloone biittafe simmida soo asaa halaqati haysata;<verse eid="EZR 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2" />Finihaasa yarape Gersoona, Itamaara yarape Daanela, Dawita yarape Sakana na7aa Haxusa,<verse eid="EZR 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3" />Paroosa yarape Zakaryaasanne enta yeleta maaran xaafetida hara issi xeetanne ishatamu addeta.<verse eid="EZR 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4" />Pahati-Moo7abe yarape Zaraha na7aa Eliho7enayanne iyara de7iya nam7u xeetu addeta.<verse eid="EZR 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5" />Zata yarape Yahazi7eela na7a Sakananne iyara de7iya heedzu xeetu addeta.<verse eid="EZR 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6" />Adina yarape Yoonataana na7aa Ebeedanne ishatamu addeta.<verse eid="EZR 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7" />Elama yarape Gotola na7a Yishayanne iyara de7iya laapun tammu addeta.<verse eid="EZR 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8" />Safaaxa yarape Mika7eela na7a Zibaadanne iyara de7iya hospun tammu addeta.<verse eid="EZR 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9" />Iyo7aaba yarape Yi7eela na7a Abdiyunne iyara de7iya nam7u xeetanne tammanne hospun addeta.<verse eid="EZR 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10" />Baana yarape Yosifiya na7a Salomitanne iyara de7iya issi xeetanne usupun tammu addeta.<verse eid="EZR 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11" />Bebaya yaraape Bebaya na7aa Zakariyasanne iyara de7iya laatamanne hospun addeta,<verse eid="EZR 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12" />Azgada yarape Haqaxaana na7a Yohaananne iyara de7iya issi xeetanne tammu addeta.<verse eid="EZR 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13" />Adonqaama yarape wursethan simmidaysati, Elfalaxa, Yi7u7eela, Shamayanne entara de7iya usupun tammu addeta.<verse eid="EZR 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14" />Bigiwaya yarape Utaya, Zakuranne entara issife hara laapun tammu addeta.<verse eid="EZR 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15" />Taani Ahawako goggiya shaafa matan enta shiishas. Nuuni he bessan dunkaanidi, heedzu gallas takida. Taani he bessan de7iya asaanne kahineta taybiya wode Leewe yarape issi asika demmabike. <verse eid="EZR 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16" />Hessa gisho, Alaazara, Ar7eela, Shamaya, Elnaatana, Yariba, Elnaatana, Naatana, Zakaryaasanne Masulaama geeteteysatanne cinca asi gidida Yoyaaribanne Elnaatana xeegas. <verse eid="EZR 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17" />Enta Kasfiya geetetiya bessan Leewetas halaqanne Xoossa keetha oosancho gidida Adosinne iya dabotas odanaba akeekisada nu Xoossa keethan oothiya ase ehana mela kiittas. <verse eid="EZR 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18" />Nu Xoossa lo77o kushey nu bolla de7iya gisho, Isra7eele na7a Leewe yara Mahila yaranne daro cinca asi gidida Sarebaya geetetiya addiya tammanne hospun iya naytanne iya ishata, nuus yeddidosona. <verse eid="EZR 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19" />Hessadaka, Hashaba, Maraara yara gidida Yashaya, iya naytanne laatamu gidiya iya ishatara yeddidosona. <verse eid="EZR 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:20" />Hessa bolla kase aawati Leeweta maaddana mela Dawitanne iyara oothiya halaqati shuumida Xoossa keetha oosanchotape nam7u xeetanne laatamu asata yeddidosona. Hessati ubbay banta sunthan xaafetidosona.<verse eid="EZR 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21" />Nu Xoossaa sinthan nu huuphiya kawushidi, ogey nuus, nu naytasinne nu shalo ubbaas saro gidana mela woossana mela yan Ahawa Shaafa matan xooma awaajas. <verse eid="EZR 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22" />Kase nuuni kawas, “Nu Xoossaa lo77o kushey iya koyeyisata bolla de7ees; shin iya wolqaama hanqoy iya aggeyisata bolla de7ees” yaagidi odida gisho, nuuni biya ogiyan de7iya morketape nuna naagana mela wotaadarenne parata immanaada kawa oychanaw yeellatas. <verse eid="EZR 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23" />Hessa gisho, nuuni xoomidi, Xoossa woossida; ika nu woosa si7is.<verse eid="EZR 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24" />Kahine halaqatape Sarebaya, Hasabayanne hara enta dabbo gidida tammu asata dooras. <verse eid="EZR 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25" />Kawoy, iyara zoreteysati, iya shuumatinne Isra7eele ubbay nu Xoossaa keethas immida bira, worqanne, hara miisheta ubbaa likada enta kushen wothas. <verse eid="EZR 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26" />Taani entaw immidabay haysa; laatamanne nam7u mukulu kilo giraame bira, heedzu mukulunne oyddu xeetu kilo giraame birape oosetida miisheta, heedzu mukulunne oyddu xeetu kilo giraame worqa, <verse eid="EZR 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27" />hospun kilo giraamenne oyddu xeetu giraame worqafe oosetida laatamu saanetanne worqada al7onne muruuto gidida naase biratape oosetida nam7u saaneta.<verse eid="EZR 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28" />Hessafe guye, taani entako haysada yaagas; “Hintenne ha miisheti Godaas dummatideta; ha biraynne worqay, asay ba dosan Godaas, hinte aawata Xoossaas immida imota. <verse eid="EZR 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29" />Yerusalaamen de7iya Xoossa keethan miishe minjiya keethaa gakidi, kahine halaqata sinthan, Leeweta sinthaninne Isra7eele yarata halaqata sinthan immana gakanaw, ha miisheta loythidi naagite” yaagas. <verse eid="EZR 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30" />Hessa gisho, kahinetinne Leeweti Yerusalaamen de7iya Xoossa keethi efanaw bira, worqanne hara miisheta ubbaa mizaanen likidi aawatethan ekidosona.<verse eid="EZR 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31" />Koyro ageenan tammanne nam7antho gallasan Yerusalaame baanaw Ahawa Shaafa matape dendida. Nu bolla de7iya nu Xoossaa lo77o kushey nu biya ogen de7iya morketapenne pangatape nuna ashshis. <verse eid="EZR 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32" />Nuuni Yerusalaame gakidi, yan heedzu gallas shempida.<verse eid="EZR 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33" />Oyddantho gallas bira, worqanne hara miisheta ubbaa likidi, Uraya na7aa kahiniya Maremootas immida. Finihaasa na7aa Alaazari, Leewe gidida Iyyasu na7aa Yozabaatinne Biniya na7a No7aadi iyara issife de7oosona. <verse eid="EZR 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34" />Ubbabay he wode taybeti liketidi xaafetis.<verse eid="EZR 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35" />Hessafe guye, di7ope simmida asay, Isra7eele Xoossaas, tammanne nam7u korma, uddufun tammanne usupun marazenne laapun tammanne laapun dorsa urgeta xuussa yarsho oothidi, qassi tammanne nam7u kole nagara yarsho oothidi Godaas yarshidosona. Hessi ubbay xuussa yarsho gididi Godaas shiiqis. <verse eid="EZR 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36" />Kawoy kiitida kiittaka kawuwape garsara biitta ayseysatasinne Efraxiisa Shaafape hefintha biitta ayseysatas immidosona; enti Isra7eele asaanne Xoossa keethaa oosuwa maaddidosona.<verse eid="EZR 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9" />
  <para style="s1">Bessona Eko-Gelo Woga Diguwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1" />Ha ubbay hanidaape guye, deriya kaaletheysati taako yidi, haysada yaagidosona; “Isra7eele asay, hari attoshin, kahineti, Leeweti, banta heeran de7iya, Kanaaneta, Hiteta, Parzeta, Yaabuseta, Amooneta, Moo7abeta, Gibxetanne Amooreta tunaape bantana shaakibookona. <verse eid="EZR 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2" />Bantawunne banta naytas Ayhude gidonna macca naytape macho ekidosona; hessa gaason geeshsha zeretha Ayhude gidonna asaara walakidosona. Ha balan koyro gididay kaaletheysatanne halaqata” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EZR 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3" />Taani ha oda si7ida wode ta ma7uwanne ta qamisiya daakas; ta huuphiyanne ta buuchaa sikas; daro dagammada utta aggas. <verse eid="EZR 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4" />Di7ope simmida asay oothida nagaraa gisho, Isra7eele Xoossay odida qaalas yayyida asa ubbay taani de7iya bessaa taako shiiqidosona. Omarsa yarsho yarshiya wode gakanaw dagammada uttida bessaafe dendabike.<verse eid="EZR 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5" />Shin omarsa yarshoy shiiqiya wode, ta ma7oynne ta qamisey daaketidi de7ishin, taani azzanada uttida bessaafe dendas. Gulbatada Godaako, ta Xoossaako, ta kushiya denthada, haysada yaagada woossas. <verse eid="EZR 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6" />“Abeeti ta Xoossaw, nu nagaray dooretidi nu huuphiyape aadhida gishonne nu naaqoy salo gakida gisho taani ta som7uwa neeko denthanaw yayyaysinne yeellatayis. <verse eid="EZR 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7" />Nuuni nu mayzata wodepe doomin, hachi gakanaw, nena daro naaqida. Nu nagaraa gaason nuuni, nu kawotinne nu kahineti ha77iysada allaga kawota kushen kundida; mashshas, do7os, bonqeesinne yeellas aadhidi imetida.<verse eid="EZR 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8" />“Shin ha77i Goday nu Xoossay nuupe guutha asi ashshanawunne ba keethan nuus besse immanaw koyidi guutha wodes marotethi immis. Hessa gisho Xoossay nu ayfiya dooyis; nu aylletethan de7ishin guutha wodes shempo immis. <verse eid="EZR 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9" />Nuuni aylle gidikoka, nu Xoossay nuna aylletethan aggibeenna; nu de7uwa oorathis. Nu Xoossaa keethaa keexana mela, laaletidaysa oorathana melanne Yihudaninne Yerusalaamen saro daana mela Farse kawota sinthan nuus teemo immis.<verse eid="EZR 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10" />“Shin nu Xoossaw, ha77i yaatin, nuuni woyganee? Heko ha77ika ne kiita toochida. <verse eid="EZR 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11" />Nu toochiday ne aylle gidida nabeta baggara ‘Hinte laattanaw geliya biittay, in de7iya asan tunidaaro; ha gaxape hini gaxaa gakanaw enta iita oosuwaninne tunatethan kumasu. <verse eid="EZR 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12" />Hessa gisho, hinte mino gidana mela, he biitta ayfiya maana melanne merinaw hinte naytas laatisana mela, hinte macca nayta enta adde naytas immofite; enta macca nayta hinte adde naytas ekofite. Enti sarotethaninne duretethan daana mela amottofite’ yaagadasa.<verse eid="EZR 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13" />“Nu bolla gakida iitaba ubbay nu iita oosuwanne nu gita nagara gaasona. Gidoshin, neeni nu Xoossay nu nagara darotethaa mela nuna pirdabaaka; shin nuupe guuthata ashshadasa. <verse eid="EZR 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14" />Nuuni haysa mela tunabaa oothiya asaara ekoninne gelon walaketidi, waanidi ne kiita ixas gaanee? Ha attida guutha kochay dhayana gakanaw ne hanqoy nu bolla dareneyee? <verse eid="EZR 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15" />Abeeti Godaw, Isra7eele Xoossaw, neeni xillo; nuuni ha77i gakanaw attidi de7on de7oos. Nu nagaraa gaason nuupe issoyka ne sinthan eqanaw danda7ey baawa; attidaysati hachi haysan ne sinthan de7oos” yaagas.<verse eid="EZR 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10" />
  <para style="s1">Asay Banta Nagara Paaxidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1" />Iziri Xoossa keetha sinthan kundidi yeekishe woossiya wodenne nagaraa paaxiya wode macci, addeynne na7i de7iya Isra7eele asay iyako shiiqidi, yibbata yeeho iyara yeekidosona. <verse eid="EZR 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2" />Elama yara gidida Yi7eela na7ay Sakan haysada yaagis; “Nuuni nu yuushon de7iya allaga maccasata ekidi, nu Xoossaas ammanetiboko. Gidoshin, ha77ika Isra7eeles ufaysi de7ees. <verse eid="EZR 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3" />Ta godaw, neeninne nu Xoossa kiita naageysati zoridaysada nuuni ha maccasaanne entafe yeletida nayta ubbaa yeddanaw qaala geloos. Hessi ubbay Godaa higgey geysada poleto. <verse eid="EZR 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4" />Izira ha oosoy ne kushen de7ees, denda; nuuni nena maaddana; minna!” yaagis.<verse eid="EZR 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5" />Iziri dendi eqidi, kahineta, Leewetanne Isra7eele asaa ubbaa ha geetetidaysata oothana mela caaqisis; entika caaqidosona. <verse eid="EZR 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6" />Iziri Xoossa keetha sinthafe dendidi, Eliyaseeba na7ay Yohaani de7iya kifile gelis. Yan di7ope simmida asay nagaras yeekishe aqida gisho, he bessan kathi mibeenna; haatheka uybeenna.<verse eid="EZR 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7" />Di7ope simmida asay Yerusalaame shiiqana mela, Yihudaninne Yerusalaamen awaajidosona. <verse eid="EZR 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:8" />Ha heedzu gallasata giddon he bessan shiiqonna oonika de7iko, iyaw de7iyabay ubbay eketana melanne ika di7ope simmida asa shiiquwape kurettana mela halaqatinne cimati oda kuuyidosona.<verse eid="EZR 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9" />He geetetida heedzu gallasata giddon, uddufuntho ageenan laatamantho gallasan Yihudanne Biniyaame asa ubbay Yerusalaame shiiqidosona. Ha deexo odaanne wolqaama ira gaason, kokorishe, Xoossaa keetha sinthan de7iya dabaaban uttidosona. <verse eid="EZR 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10" />Kahine Iziri dendiidi haysada yaagis; “Hinte ammanetonna ixideta; allaga maccasata macho ekidi, Isra7eele naaquwa bolla naaqo gujideta. <verse eid="EZR 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11" />Hinte nagara Godaas, hinte aawata Xoossas paaxite; iya ufaysiyaba oothite. He biittan de7iya Ayhude gidonna asaapenne hinte ekida Ayhude gidonna hinte machetape shaaketite” yaagis.<verse eid="EZR 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12" />Shiiqida asay banta qaala dhoqu oothidi, haysada yaagidosona. “Ne giyaba ubba nuuni oothana! <verse eid="EZR 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13" />Shin haysan shiiqida asay daro; hessa bolla wolqaama iri bukees. Nuuni irape attiya bessi haysan baawa. Ha nagaran qohida asay daro gidida gisho, issi gallasan woyko nam7u gallasan ha oda polanaw danda7oko. <verse eid="EZR 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14" />Ha shiiqida asaa sunthan nu halaqati Yerusalaamen gam7idi, koshshiyaba ootho. Hessa gaason dendada Xoossaa wolqaama hanqoy nuupe simmana gakanaw, nu katamatan de7iya Ayhude gidonna maccasata ekida ubbay keerida qamman katamata cimatinne daynnatara issife Yerusalaame yo. <verse eid="EZR 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15" />Asaheela na7ay Yoonataaninne Tequwa na7ay Yahizi enta qofaa phalqidosona; Masulaaminne Leewe gidida Sabati entana maaddidosona” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EZR 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16" />Di7ope simmida asay gidaysada oothidosona. Kahiney Iziri ubba kochatape halaqata dooridi, ubbaa enta sunthan sunthan xaafis. Tammantho ageenan koyro gallasan halaqati oda pilgidi be7o doomidosona. <verse eid="EZR 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17" />Koyro ageenan koyro gallasay gakanaw, Ayhude gidonna maccasata ekida asata ubbaa pilgidi wursidosona.<verse eid="EZR 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Allaga Macho Ekida Asata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18" />Kahine kochata giddofe allaga maccasata ekidaysati haysata; Iyosadeqa na7a Iyyasu kochatapenne iya ishata giddofe Ma7iseya, Alaazara, Yaribanne Godoliya. <verse eid="EZR 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19" />Enti banta macheta yeddanaw qaala gelidosona; banta nagara gisho, wudiyape issi issi maraze naaqo yarsho oothidi yarshidosona. <verse eid="EZR 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20" />Imera yarape Allaga macheta ekidaysati Hanaananne Zabada. <verse eid="EZR 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21" />Harima yarape Ma7iseya, Eeliyaasa, Shamaya, Yi7eelanne Ooziya. <verse eid="EZR 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22" />Paskora yarape Eliyo7anaya, Ma7iseya, Isma7eela, Natina7eela, Yozabaatanne Elsi.<verse eid="EZR 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23" />Leewetape, Yozabaata, Same7a, Qalixa geetetiya Qelaya, Fataya, Yihudanne Alaazara.<verse eid="EZR 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24" />Zammaaretape, Eliyaseeba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 10:24">Penge naageysatape, Saluma, Xelemanne Ure.<verse eid="EZR 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25" />Isra7eeletape, Faroosa yarape Ramiya, Yizaya, Malkiya, Mayamina, Alaazara, Malkiyanne Banaya.<verse eid="EZR 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26" />Elama yarape Mataana, Zakaryaasa, Yi7eela, Abda, Yiremootanne Ela.<verse eid="EZR 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27" />Zata yarape Eliyo7ana, Eliyaseeba, Mataana, Yiremoota, Zabadanne Aziiza.<verse eid="EZR 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28" />Babaya yarape Yohaana, Hanaana, Zabayanne Atilaya.<verse eid="EZR 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29" />Baana yarape Masulaama, Maluka, Adaya, Yasuuba, Shaalanne Yiremoota.<verse eid="EZR 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30" />Pahati-Moo7aba yarape Adina, Kalala, Banaya, Ma7iseya, Mataana, Basili7eela, Binuyanne Minaase.<verse eid="EZR 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31" />Karima yarape Alaazara, Yisheya, Malkiya, Shamaya, Simoona, <verse eid="EZR 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:32" />Biniyaame, Malukanne Samaraya.<verse eid="EZR 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33" />Hasuma yarape Mataana, Mataata, Zabada, Elfalaxa, Yeremaya, Minaasenne Same7a.<verse eid="EZR 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34" />Baana yarape Madaya, Amraama, Ula, <verse eid="EZR 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 10:35" />Banaya, Bedaya, Kalqe, <verse eid="EZR 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 10:36" />Waaniya, Maremoota, Eliyaseeba, <verse eid="EZR 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:37" />Mataana Matinayanne Ya7isa.<verse eid="EZR 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38" />Binuya yarape Sama7a, <verse eid="EZR 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 10:39" />Selema, Naatana, Adaya, <verse eid="EZR 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 10:40" />Makinadabaya, Sasaya, Saraya, <verse eid="EZR 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 10:41" />Azari7eela, Selema, Samara, <verse eid="EZR 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:42" />Saluma, Amaarenne Yoosefa.<verse eid="EZR 10:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43" />Nabo yarape Yi7eela, Matita, Zabada, Zabina, Yadaya, Iyyu7eelanne Banaya.<verse eid="EZR 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44" />Ha ubbay Ayhude gidonna macheta ekidaysata; issoti issoti na7aka yelidosona.<verse eid="EZR 10:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10" />
</usx>